Here base() (and offset()) emit a load
instruction:
loadi BASE_x_
where BASE_x_ is a constant
computed from the symbol table for
the storage of ’x’
• BASE_x_ is LocIdx from the symbol
table, as index to the location store
Offset matters for arrays and structs
that we will discuss later

